  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "github:522877749",
      "name": "aiku",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "AGPL-3.0 的开源商务 ERP/Web 应用，内含自营仓库履约子模块：渠道订单进入同一仓库队列，按库位持有库存，配送单按状态推进拣选、打包、承运商发货并回传渠道。",
      "homepage": "https://aiku.io/",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/Inikoo-Ltd/aiku",
      "github_repository_id": 522877749,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Inikoo-Ltd/aiku/license",
      "features": [
        "配送单（delivery note）按 to do、queued、handling（picking）、picked、packing、packed、finalised、dispatched 的状态队列推进，并记录拣货人、打包人与发货时间",
        "仓库与库位管理：区域、库位、库存数量与估值，拣货路径与拣货批次（picking session），打包台、箱型与包裹记录",
        "承运商 API 与发货：DPD、GLS、APC、CTT、Packeta、ITD，finalise 与 dispatch 合并完成并记录发货时间",
        "销售渠道接入：Shopify、WooCommerce、Magento、TikTok Shop、Amazon、eBay、Allegro 等，渠道订单进入同一仓库队列，产品、订单与 shipment 双向同步",
        "手持终端应用用于拣货、打包与扫描"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "README 提供源码自托管步骤：composer install、npm install、配置 .env、php artisan migrate --seed、npm run dev",
        "技术栈为 PHP 8.4 / Laravel、PostgreSQL、Redis、Typesense，前端 Vue 3 + Inertia，另提供 React Native 手持端"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "PHP 8.4 / Laravel 13（Octane、Horizon、Passport）",
        "PostgreSQL 18 + pgvector、Redis、Typesense",
        "Vue 3、Inertia v2、Tailwind、Vite、TypeScript",
        "React Native（仓库手持端与员工移动端）"
      ],
